WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.840
Learn in your browser first: Learn in your browser first. You do not need to install anything to start Module 1 online. Open Start Here, pick Python, C sharp, or A I, and mark steps done as you go.

2
00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:25.358
When you want files on your computer: When you want files on your computer, use GitHub’s Code menu and choose Download ZIP. Find the file in Downloads, then unzip it. Git is optional — beginners can use the ZIP.

3
00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:37.420
Open the right folder: Open the right folder for your course. Python lives in python-beginner-workbook. C sharp lives in csharp-beginner-workbook. Always start with Module 1 setup.

4
00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:46.290
Quick tip: Quick tip: if a download goes missing, check the Help page. You can keep learning online while installers run in the background.
